  "Name": "Okta - Admin & Configuration Changes - Okta Application Sign-On Policy Modified or Deleted",
  "Description": "Alert: Alert - Okta - Admin & Configuration Changes\nMITRE ATT&CK: Defense Evasion / T1562\nSchedule: every 15 minutes over the previous 15 minutes (edit the scheduled search to change it)\nTuning: okta_user_allowlist / okta_ip_allowlist keys \"<login without domain>|Okta Application Sign-On Policy Modified or Deleted\" or \"<ip>|Okta Application Sign-On Policy Modified or Deleted\"\n\nDetects when an application Sign-on Policy is modified or deleted.\n\nReference(s):\n- https://detection.fyi/sigmahq/sigma/identity/okta/okta_application_sign_on_policy_modified_or_deleted/\n- https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/identity/okta/?query=okta.yml",
